{"type":"message","id":"d4927b13","parentId":"878e0e19","timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:17:06.828Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_f6db87d63cf747a2a92e3ff8","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\n      \"name\": \"daily-backup\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774507489594,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774915387884,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 0 * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行备份：cd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \\\"auto backup $(date +\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d)\\\" && git push && echo \\\"备份完成\\\"\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n        \"accountId\": \"lucus\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775001600000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774915200003,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 187881,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"unknown\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 2,\n        \"lastError\": \"Channel is required (no configured channels detected). Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"config-backup-8am\",\n      \"name\": \"config-backup-8am\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774843680000,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774944774164,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 8 * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"备份 openclaw.json：cp ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-$(date +%Y%m%d) && echo \\\"openclaw.json 备份完成 $(date)\\\"\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n        \"accountId\": \"lucus\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775030400000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774944757062,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 17102,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774948626826}}
{"type":"message","id":"fe649848","parentId":"d4927b13","timestamp":"2026-03-31T09:17:24.591Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I have a clear picture of the issue:\n\n**daily-backup 失败原因:**\n- 错误信息: \"Channel is required (no configured channels detected). Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\"\n- 已经连续错误 2 次 (consecutiveErrors: 2)\n- lastDurationMs: 18788ms (约19秒)\n\n**config-backup-8am 正常工作:**\n- lastRunStatus: \"ok\"\n- lastDeliveryStatus: \"delivered\"\n- 持续时间: 17102ms (约17秒)\n\n两者的配置几乎一样，都使用 feishu channel。区别是 daily-backup 使用了 \"isolated\" session target，而 config-backup-8am 可能运行正常是因为之前的某次运行成功了。\n\n不过 daily-backup 的配置看起来有问题。让我提供完整的分析报告给用户。\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## Cron 任务检查结果\n\n### ✅ 正常运行\n| 任务 | 调度 | 状态 | 最后运行 |\n|-----|------|------|---------|\n| config-backup-8am | 每天 8:00 | ok | 1小时前 |\n\n### ❌ 存在问题\n| 任务 | 调度 | 状态 | 最后运行 |\n|-----|------|------|---------|\n| daily-backup | 每天 0:00 | **error** | 9小时前 |\n\n---\n\n### daily-backup 失败原因\n\n**错误信息:**\n> Channel is required (no configured channels detected). Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\n\n**详细状态:**\n- 连续错误次数: 2 次\n- 运行时长: ~19秒\n- 交付状态: unknown\n\n**备份命令:**\n```bash\ncd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \"auto backup $(date +%Y-%m-%d)\" && git push && echo \"备份完成\"\n```\n\n---\n\n### 建议修复\n\n两个任务的配置几乎相同，但 `daily-backup` 报错说找不到 channel。这可能是临时性问题或 Gateway 缓存问题。\n\n你可以尝试：\n\n1. **手动运行测试:**\n   ```\n   openclaw cron run daily-backup\n   ```\n\n2. **或者删除重建:**\n   ```\n   openclaw cron rm daily-backup\n   openclaw cron add ...\n   ```\n\n需要我帮你修复吗？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774948626832,"responseId":"chatcmpl