{"type":"message","id":"d6b0deb0","parentId":"881a12b2","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:31:15.804Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"从帮助信息看，`openclaw update` 命令会进行 git checkout 和 npm install。关键问题是这个命令是否能在 Docker 容器内正常工作。\n\n用户是通过 Docker 安装的 OpenClaw。在 Docker 环境中：\n1. 如果是从源码挂载运行的（volume mount），update 应该可以工作\n2. 如果是使用 Docker 镜像安装，update 只能在容器内部执行，但不会自动重建 Docker 镜像\n\n让我检查一下当前是否是 Docker 环境，以及安装方式。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_b070c2d3f372416795fe6d97","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"cat /proc/1/cgroup 2>/dev/null | head -5"}},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bf3f3814b0ca46de8bc38bd4","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"which docker 2>/dev/null && docker ps 2>/dev/null | grep -i openclaw || echo \"not in docker or no docker access\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774963868825,"responseId":"chatcmpl-f0642e30fecbb80be3d01047564c72e1"}}
