{"type":"message","id":"e071a671","parentId":"a4f6e4c1","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:32:20.313Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"看起来 `/home/node` 是一个独立的挂载点，这可能是 Docker volume。这意味着 OpenClaw 的源代码和数据都存储在这个 volume 中。\n\n让我回答用户的问题：在 Docker 中，`openclaw update` 可以运行，但有限制：\n- 如果是从源码安装（git clone）的，update 可以正常工作\n- 如果是使用 Docker 镜像安装的，update 只能在容器内部执行 npm 安装，但需要手动重启容器才能使用新版本\n\n但实际上当前的设置看起来是源码安装（git + npm），所以 update 应该可以工作。\n\n不过需要提醒的是，在 Docker 环境中运行 update 后，需要确保服务能正确重启。让我测试一下 update status。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_bfff0f99b4ea4c7782d1fdda","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw update status 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774963934470,"responseId":"chatcmpl-23988b53a9ac1e200262063e9cce2996"}}
