{"type":"message","id":"7dafcc7c","parentId":"92541646","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:35:21.144Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户决定通过重新拉取 Docker 镜像然后重启的方式来进行更新。这是一个更纯粹的 Docker 方式。让我提供正确的命令。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n好的，这是更干净的 Docker 方式：\n\n```bash\n# 1. 拉取最新镜像\ndocker pull openclaw/openclaw:latest\n\n# 2. 重启容器（如果你是用 docker-compose）\ndocker-compose up -d\n\n# 或者（如果你直接用 docker run）\ndocker stop <容器名> && docker rm <容器名>\ndocker run -d ... # 原来的启动命令\n```\n\n需要我帮你查看原来的启动命令吗？或者你用的是 docker-compose？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774964110981,"responseId":"chatcmpl-111a2ac75315d3492f206d2b3e66ff37"}}
