{"type":"message","id":"4e105440","parentId":"b2cfcf18","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:39:00.394Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"我当前没有 docker 命令执行权限。这是预期的，因为我在容器内部无法执行 docker 命令（没有挂载 socket）。用户应该在他们自己的宿主机上运行这些命令。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n我当前在容器内无法执行 Docker 命令（没有 docker socket）。\n\n你可以在**宿主机**上运行：\n\n```bash\n# 查看已拉取的镜像\ndocker images openclaw/openclaw\n\n# 查看具体版本标签\ndocker images openclaw/openclaw --format \"{{.Tag}}: {{.CreatedAt}}\"\n\n# 或者查看正在运行的容器版本\ndocker ps --format \"table {{.Image}}\\t{{.CreatedAt}}\"\n```\n\n一般 latest 标签对应的就是最新稳定版。如果想指定版本，也可以拉取具体 tag：\n\n```bash\ndocker pull openclaw/openclaw:2026.3.28\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774964333540,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0feaae749dc23f3669607eec3823fe42"}}
