{"type":"message","id":"a3547edf","parentId":"d2bba9fd","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:43:11.054Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户在问 docker-compose up -d 之前是否需要先执行 down。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**不需要**必须执行 `down`，但有几种情况：\n\n## 方式一：直接 up（推荐）\n```bash\ndocker-compose up -d\n```\n- 如果容器已运行，会**重建**并启动（相当于 update）\n- 数据 volume 会保留\n\n## 方式二：先 down 再 up\n```bash\ndocker-compose down\ndocker-compose up -d\n```\n- 彻底停止并删除容器\n- **但**如果 docker-compose.yml 里没有定义 volume，数据会丢失！\n\n## 你的情况\n\n检查一下你的 docker-compose.yml 是否有 volume 定义：\n\n```bash\n# 在宿主机上查看\ncat docker-compose.yml | grep -A 5 volumes\n```\n\n如果像官方示例那样有持久化 volume（比如 `~/.openclaw:/home/node/.openclaw`），直接 `up -d` 就够了。\n\n---\n\n**简单记忆：**\n- 想保留数据 → 直接 `docker-compose up -d`\n- 想完全重置 → `docker-compose down` + `up -d`"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774964561587,"responseId":"chatcmpl-dcd04c2b8d19285601b06a81b6ffab69"}}
{"type":"message","id":"82f8ed6f","parentId":"a3547edf","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:44:18.538Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b5388b5c188a8eea75bd0c990960\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-31 13:44 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b5388b5c188a8eea75bd0c990960]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a:  volumes:\n      - ${OPENCLAW_CONFIG_DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw\n      - ${OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\n      ## Uncomment the lines below to enable sandbox isolation\n      ## (agents.defaults.sandbox). Requires Docker CLI in the image\n      ## (build with --build-arg OPENCLAW_INSTALL_DOCKER_CLI=1) or use\n--\n    volumes:\n      - ${OPENCLAW_CONFIG_DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw\n      - ${OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw/workspace\n    stdin_open: true\n    tty: true\n    init: true"}],"timestamp":1774964658535}}
{"type":"message","id":"06861172","parentId":"82f8ed6f","timestamp":"2026-03-31T13:44:42.210Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"用户展示了 docker-compose.yml 中的 volumes 配置。可以看到有两个持久化 volume：\n\n1. `${OPENCLAW_CONFIG__DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw` - 配置目录\n2. `${OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw/workspace` - 工作区目录\n\n这意味着数据是持久化的，直接 `docker-compose up -d` 不会丢失数据。\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n好，有两个持久化 volume：\n- `${OPENCLAW_CONFIG_DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw` → 配置\n- `${OPENCLAW_WORKSPACE_DIR}:/home/node/.openclaw/workspace` → 工作区\n\n**数据会保留，直接运行即可：**\n```bash\ndocker-compose up -d\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"scnet","model":"MiniMax-M2.5","usage":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":0,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774964658538,"responseId":"chatcmpl-906bb9d087dc286bdf7dea84d02dff5d"}}
