{"type":"message","id":"a4f8b8bd","parentId":"e6aa628d","timestamp":"2026-03-31T14:03:13.804Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the config file. The issue is with the `channels.feishu` section. Looking at the error message:\n\n```\n- channels.feishu: invalid config: must NOT have additional properties\n- channels.feishu.accounts.main: invalid config: must NOT have additional properties\n- channels.feishu.accounts.lucus: invalid config: must NOT have additional properties\n```\n\nThe new version has stricter schema validation and doesn't allow certain additional properties. Looking at the current config:\n\n```json\n\"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"streaming\": true,\n      \"footer\": {\n        \"status\": true,\n        \"elapsed\": true\n      },\n      \"requireMention\": true,\n      \"threadSession\": true,\n      \"domain\": \"lark\",\n      \"accounts\": {\n        \"main\": {\n          \"appId\": \"cli_a9243f0855b89e1b\",\n          \"appSecret\": \"YpMh4x85MwnG3DNjeERnDfNaJs2IM1OA\",\n          \"botName\": \"Talus\",\n          \"dmPolicy\": \"allowlist\",\n          \"allowFrom\": [\n            \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"lucus\": {\n          \"appId\": \"cli_a93108fad2b81e15\",\n          \"appSecret\": \"YXsvQgicI06FJkWenoDpggitFT6TCgVq\",\n          \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n          \"botName\": \"Lucus\"\n        },\n        \"default\": {\n          \"groupPolicy\": \"allowlist\",\n          \"groupAllowFrom\": [\n            \"oc_863283a354081978577fc20760b58802\"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n```\n\nThe new version likely requires a different structure for channel accounts, possibly using a `channels[].accounts[].id` format instead of nested objects, or maybe the `accounts` key itself has been removed or restructured entirely.","thinkingSignature":"f286baad4bae579aa07a71e9d9d1c46ef9b8b52b5a6ffe8a4cf6496c793f0b8a"},{"type":"text","text":"看到了！问题是 3.28 版本对 `channels.feishu` 的 schema 做了修改，不允许额外的属性。\n\n让我查一下最新的文档或 changelog：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bdifcm6q3vch_1","name":"web_fetch","arguments":{"url":"https://docs.openclaw.ai/changelog.md","maxChars":10000}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"minimax-m2.5:free","usage":{"input":14290,"output":532,"cacheRead":11123,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":25945,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774965773387,"responseId":"061b070d51da2aefa84deadf08f62367"}}
