eb Search\\n---\\nThe official OpenClaw cloud platform. Launch your automated AI agent without coding. Give OpenClaw persistent memory! Your 24/7 AI agent handles complex tasks autonomously.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"6d384793744ac626\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"duckduckgo.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0f652bea8baec8d0\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nBug: Configuration Migration Failure During Upgrade (v3.24 → v3.28)\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0f652bea8baec8d0\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/57567\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c2b83fdf41639b1c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nSummary After upgrading from v3.24 to v3.28, the OpenClaw gateway failed to start due to corrupted configuration file generated by the migration script. The openclaw doctor --fix command was also u...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"c2b83fdf41639b1c\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"github.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"25080b483f3eaa3f\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFeishu - OpenClaw\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"25080b483f3eaa3f\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://docs.openclaw.ai/channels/feishu\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e070e19b8436a701\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nVerification Token and Encrypt Key (webhook mode) When using webhook mode, set both channels . feishu .verificationToken and channels . feishu .encryptKey in your config . To get the values: In Feishu Open Platform, open your app Go to Development → Events & Callbacks (开发配置 → 事件与回调) Open the Encryption tab (加密策略) Copy Verification Token and Encrypt Key The screenshot ...\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"e070e19b8436a701\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"docs.openclaw.ai\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"27d303a3852e16e2\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw v2026.3.28 — xAI/tools, MiniMax\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"27d303a3852e16e2\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://openclaw-hub.com/releases/v2026.3.28/\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f7daa7bb8cb13973\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n⚠️ Breaking Changes Providers/Qwen: remove the deprecated qwen-portal-auth OAuth integration for portal.qwen.ai; migrate to Model Studio with openclaw onboard --auth-choice modelstudio-api-key. Thanks-nwu Config /Doctor: drop automatic config migrations older than two months; very old legacy keys now fail validation instead of being rewritten on load or by openclaw doctor\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"f7daa7bb8cb13973\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"openclaw-hub.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7bc2966f49dbfcfe\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nOpenClaw: docs/channels/feishu.md | Fossies\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7bc2966f49dbfcfe\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://fossies.org/linux/openclaw/docs/channels/feishu.md\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0d2c442fbf1b898c\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nFeishu bot Feishu (Lark) is a team chat platform used by companies for messaging and collaboration. This plugin connects OpenClaw to a Feishu /Lark bot using the platform's WebSocket event subscription so messages can be received without exposing a public webhook URL.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"0d2c442fbf1b898c\\\">>>\",\n      \"siteName\": \"fossies.org\"\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"details":{"query":"openclaw 3.28 changelog breaking changes channels feishu config","provider":"duckduckgo","count":5,"tookMs":1047,"externalContent":{"untrusted":true,"source":"web_search","provider":"duckduckgo","wrapped":true},"results":[{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"1184bdf0979d0db0\">>>\nSource: We