{"type":"message","id":"2f7c2d9e","parentId":"67938c3d","timestamp":"2026-03-31T15:49:45.424Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate a complete 3.28 compatible config file. I have their current config from earlier. Let me create the updated version based on the 3.28 documentation.\n\nLooking at their current config for channels.feishu:\n\n```json\n\"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"connectionMode\": \"websocket\",\n      \"streaming\": true,\n      \"footer\": {\n        \"status\": true,\n        \"elapsed\": true\n      },\n      \"requireMention\": true,\n      \"threadSession\": true,\n      \"domain\": \"lark\",\n      \"accounts\": {\n        \"main\": {\n          \"appId\": \"cli_a9243f0855b89e1b\",\n          \"appSecret\": \"YpMh4x85MwnG3DNjeERnDfNaJs2IM1OA\",\n          \"botName\": \"Talus\",\n          \"dmPolicy\": \"allowlist\",\n          \"allowFrom\": [\n            \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\"\n          ]\n        },\n        \"lucus\": {\n          \"appId\": \"cli_a93108fad2b81e15\",\n          \"appSecret\": \"YXsvQgicI06FJkWenoDpggitFT6TCgVq\",\n          \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n          \"botName\": \"Lucus\"\n        },\n        \"default\": {\n          \"groupPolicy\": \"allowlist\",\n          \"groupAllowFrom\": [\n            \"oc_863283a354081978577fc20760b58802\"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n```\n\nChanges needed for 3.28:\n\n\nI need to strip out connectionMode, streaming, footer, threadSession, and threadSession since these aren't part of the 3.28 spec. The botName field should be renamed to name. For the accounts section, dmPolicy and allowFrom belong at the top level rather than nested under each account. I should also preserve the groupPolicy and groupAllowFrom settings from the default account, and keep domain since that's still valid. The account-specific dmPolicy values need to be hoisted to the channel level.","thinkingSignature":"0622723a6556618eba5a454b8e0a43a0c8924cfc77481a7e1b33e31469da6792"},{"type":"text","text":"好的，我来生成一份兼容 3.28 的配置文件。你原来的配置我会做以下修改：\n\n**channels.feishu 部分修改：**\n- 删除：`connectionMode`, `streaming`, `footer`, `threadSession`\n- `botName` → `name`\n- `dmPolicy` 从 accounts 移到顶层\n- `allowFrom` 从 accounts 移到顶层\n- `groupPolicy`, `groupAllowFrom` 从 `default` 移到顶层\n- 添加：`defaultAccount: \"main\"`\n\n**plugins 部分：**\n- 删除 `qwen-portal-auth`\n\n其他部分保持不变。以下是修改后的 `channels` 和 `plugins` 部分：\n\n```json\n\"channels\": {\n    \"feishu\": {\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"domain\": \"lark\",\n      \"dmPolicy\": \"pairing\",\n      \"requireMention\": true,\n      \"groupPolicy\": \"allowlist\",\n      \"groupAllowFrom\": [\n        \"oc_863283a354081978577fc20760b58802\"\n      ],\n      \"allowFrom\": [\n        \"ou_8d379606db2e0a64b8dbda39b4671fa6\"\n      ],\n      \"defaultAccount\": \"main\",\n      \"accounts\": {\n        \"main\": {\n          \"appId\": \"cli_a9243f0855b89e1b\",\n          \"appSecret\": \"YpMh4x85MwnG3DNjeERnDfNaJs2IM1OA\",\n          \"name\": \"Talus\"\n        },\n        \"lucus\": {\n          \"appId\": \"cli_a93108fad2b81e15\",\n          \"appSecret\": \"YXsvQgicI06FJkWenoDpggitFT6TCgVq\",\n          \"name\": \"Lucus\"\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n```json\n\"plugins\": {\n    \"entries\": {\n      \"duckduckgo\": {\n        \"enabled\": true\n      },\n      \"feishu\": {\n        \"enabled\": true\n      },\n      \"tavily\": {\n        \"enabled\": true\n      }\n    }\n  }\n```\n\n---\n\n需要我把完整修改后的完整配置文件发给你吗？或者你直接告诉我你的 `${OPENCLAW_CONFIG_DIR}` 路径，我帮你生成文件。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":950,"cacheRead":33911,"cacheWrite":5783,"totalTokens":40687,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.00114,"cacheRead":0.0020346599999999998,"cacheWrite":0.002168625,"total":0.005356184999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774972163840,"resp