{"type":"message","id":"18b8c053","parentId":"9aefa7b6","timestamp":"2026-03-31T15:54:15.571Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The configuration looks good now. But wait - I notice the `appSecret` values are still there in plain text. This is the same issue as before - the user is concerned about privacy, but these are actually their own secrets from their own config. However, I should be careful not to repeat them in my response.\n\nThe config looks correct now for 3.28:\n- Removed: connectionMode, streaming, footer, threadSession, reactionNotifications\n- Kept: domain, dmPolicy, groupPolicy, requireMention, defaultAccount, typingIndicator, resolveSenderNames\n- Fixed: botName → name in accounts\n- Removed: the \"default\" pseudo-account with misplaced dmPolicy/groupPolicy\n- Now dmPolicy and groupPolicy are at the top level as they should be\n\nThe configuration is now compatible with 3.28 according to the docs. The user can now try to run the container with the new image.","thinkingSignature":"6bdced8031d6f576d90ce8be766c087ea7950d30fd3e33eae22b9362617e1b7e"},{"type":"text","text":"✅ `channels.feishu` 配置已修正完成。\n\n**修改内容：**\n- ✅ 移除：`connectionMode`、`streaming`、`footer`、`threadSession`、`reactionNotifications`\n- ✅ `botName` → `name`\n- ✅ `dmPolicy`、`groupPolicy` 从 `default` 账户移到顶层\n- ✅ 移除无效的 `default` 账户\n- ✅ 保留：`typingIndicator`、`resolveSenderNames`（文档中支持的优化参数）\n- ✅ `qwen-portal-auth` 已删除\n\n现在配置已适配 3.28，你可以尝试用新镜像启动容器了：\n\n```bash\ndocker pull openclaw/openclaw:latest\ndocker-compose up -d\n```"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":32353,"output":334,"cacheRead":11956,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":44643,"cost":{"input":0.0097059,"output":0.0004008,"cacheRead":0.0007173599999999999,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01082406}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774972446286,"responseId":"061b211ebcebf9214ec602abe06cac6a"}}
