{"type":"message","id":"b437db24","parentId":"0972e87c","timestamp":"2026-03-31T16:26:37.248Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The plugin is asking for WeChat QR code scan. It seems the user needs to scan a QR code to connect their WeChat account. This is running in the container and showing a QR code, but the user is likely on a different interface (Feishu).\n\nThe process is waiting for the WeChat scan. I should inform the user that they need to:\n1. Scan the QR code with their WeChat app\n2. Or use the URL to scan\n\nBut since I'm running in a container, the QR code might not be visible to the user in Feishu. The user might need to do this on a different interface or get the URL.\n\nLet me provide information about what's happening.","thinkingSignature":"dba16fe591c47c425fc3c9cd0a1796b52cd9740bef1b424bfb526ef8f9d25a65"},{"type":"text","text":"微信插件安装成功，正在等待微信扫码连接。\n\n⚠️ **安全警告：** 安装过程中检测到此插件包含危险代码模式（shell 命令执行、环境变量访问结合网络发送）。建议谨慎使用。\n\n**当前状态：**\n- 安装完成：`openclaw-weixin` 插件已安装\n- 需要扫码：用微信扫描上方二维码完成连接\n- 或者点击链接扫码：https://liteapp.weixin.qq.com/q/7GiQu1?qrcode=...\n\n**注意：** 这个二维码扫描需要在能显示二维码的界面操作（直接在容器终端或访问 URL）。\n\n你需要手动扫码完成连接吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":35094,"output":271,"cacheRead":11957,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47322,"cost":{"input":0.0105282,"output":0.0003252,"cacheRead":0.00071742,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.011570819999999999}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774974387331,"responseId":"061b28b496a86039aea8d5a922383ef4"}}
{"type":"message","id":"0767fa59","parentId":"b437db24","timestamp":"2026-03-31T16:30:03.133Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b538b29a9e0a0ee78ed5ae45af7d\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Tue 2026-03-31 16:29 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\"\n}\n```\n\n[message_id: om_x100b538b29a9e0a0ee78ed5ae45af7d]\nou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a: 当前3.28版本是不是本身就支持微信了，我安装这个插件是多余吧"}],"timestamp":1774974603107}}
{"type":"message","id":"b2661ccb","parentId":"0767fa59","timestamp":"2026-03-31T16:30:17.838Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking whether OpenClaw 3.28 already has built-in WeChat support, making the plugin installation unnecessary.\n\nLet me think about this. OpenClaw is a multi-channel messaging platform that supports various channels like Feishu, Telegram, Discord, etc. WeChat is a separate channel that typically requires a plugin because:\n\n1. WeChat official accounts/enterprise accounts have specific API limitations\n2. WeChat doesn't have an official open WebSocket-based event subscription like Telegram or Discord\n3. WeChat integration usually requires either:\n   - WeChat Work (企业微信) webhook-based approach\n   - Unofficial approaches using QR code scanning (like this plugin appears to do)\n\nFrom what I saw in the search results earlier, the feishu plugin is bundled with OpenClaw. WeChat is not mentioned as a bundled channel.\n\nThe plugin we just installed (`@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin`) appears to be a third-party plugin that uses QR code scanning for personal WeChat accounts, which is different from official WeChat Enterprise API.\n\nSo no, OpenClaw doesn't have built-in WeChat support - WeChat requires a plugin. The user might be confused because Feishu (飞书) is sometimes referred to as \"Lark\" internationally, which is different from WeChat.\n\nI should clarify that:\n1. OpenClaw has built-in support for Feishu (飞书/Lark)\n2. WeChat (微信) is NOT built-in and requires a plugin\n3. The plugin we installed is for personal WeChat via QR code login, which is a third-party approach","thinkingSignature":"07e102b14d83837e1f6f6c80f07635f842302b2bf204c30ae236388de170d87d"},{"type":"text","text":"不是多余的。OpenClaw 内置支持的 channel 是 **飞书 (Feishu/Lark)**，不是 **微信 (WeChat)**。\n\n| 平台 | 内置支持 | 需要插件 |\n|------|---------|---------|\n| 飞书 (Feishu/Lark) | ✅ 内置 | 否 |\n| 微信 (WeChat) | ❌ 不支持 | ✅ 需要插件 |\n| Telegram | ✅ 内置 | 否 |\n| Discord | ✅ 内置 | 否 |\n\n所以你安装的 `@tencent-weixin/openclaw-weixin` 插件是必要的，用于连接微信账号。\n\n不过如果你不需要微信 channel，可以忽略这个插件。但如果你想用微信收发消息，就需要它。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":477,"cacheRead":11957,"cacheWrite":35062,"totalTokens":47539,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.0005723999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00071742,"cacheWrite":0.01314825,"total":0.01445097}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774974603136,"responseId":"061b298bf801597167ac9c49694c4609"}}
