{"type":"message","id":"c070a822","parentId":"48a9691f","timestamp":"2026-03-31T16:33:01.106Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, the plugin is already enabled. Now I need to help with the QR code login. The issue is that in the Docker container, we can't display a QR code in the terminal directly. The user needs to do this on their host machine or through some other means.\n\nLet me provide instructions for the user.","thinkingSignature":"e00534b238b6fd2327da7821957a7e520f809dbb46b1e2c247e728cccc973b5c"},{"type":"text","text":"插件已启用 ✅\n\n现在需要扫码登录。在 Docker 容器内无法直接显示二维码，你需要在**宿主机**上执行：\n\n```bash\n# 在宿主机上运行\nopenclaw channels login --channel openclaw-weixin\n```\n\n这会在终端显示二维码，用微信扫描即可。\n\n---\n\n**注意：** 如果你在容器环境，可能需要先确认 `openclaw` 命令在宿主机上可用。如果不可用，可能需要先在宿主机上安装 OpenClaw CLI。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":36921,"output":164,"cacheRead":11957,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49042,"cost":{"input":0.011076299999999999,"output":0.00019679999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00071742,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01199052}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774974774702,"responseId":"061b2a37cfb4421548398c9eb3906797"}}
