{"type":"message","id":"1229f8ab","parentId":"3f8de681","timestamp":"2026-03-31T16:47:32.797Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Good, now let me verify the duplicate warning is gone by checking the config. But actually, I should also check if there's anything in `plugins.entries` that might be causing the duplicate. The warning says \"global plugin will be overridden by global plugin\" which is a bit confusing. Let me check if the issue is in the config structure itself.\n\nActually, looking at the warning more carefully: \"global plugin will be overridden by global plugin\" - this seems like a bug in the warning message, or it means the same plugin is being loaded twice from two different paths.\n\nWait, looking at the earlier install output:\n```\nWARNING: Plugin \"openclaw-weixin\" contains dangerous code patterns...\nInstalling to /home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin…\nInstalling plugin dependencies…\n...\nplugins.allow is empty; discovered non-bundled plugins may auto-load: openclaw-weixin (/home/node/.openclaw/extensions/.openclaw-install-stage-pFltcW/index.ts), openclaw-weixin (/home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin/index.ts)\n```\n\nSo the issue was that BOTH directories were being loaded. I deleted the staging one. But there might also be an entry in `plugins.entries` that explicitly references the plugin.\n\nActually, the config already shows:\n```json\n\"openclaw-weixin\": {\n  \"enabled\": true,\n  \"config\": {}\n}\n```\n\nThis is in `plugins.entries`. And the `plugins.installs` section also has it. The warning might be saying that the entry in `plugins.entries` is being overridden by the auto-discovered plugin in extensions.\n\nLet me check if removing the staging directory fixed the issue. The user might need to restart the gateway for changes to take effect.\n\nActually, let me also check if the `plugins.entries` entry is necessary or if it should be removed since the plugin is auto-discovered now.","thinkingSignature":"05a8dc0fce7009477587dad553d18a6d695abbaa675b573892db6aa641301d7e"},{"type":"text","text":"已删除临时目录。现在重启 Gateway 让配置生效：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_gx5u9blckz1q_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"openclaw gateway restart 2>&1","timeout":30}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":38593,"output":439,"cacheRead":11957,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50989,"cost":{"input":0.011577899999999999,"output":0.0005268,"cacheRead":0.00071742,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.01282212}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774975641967,"responseId":"061b2d9ad0437b8cd221ec0b86e82371"}}
