{"type":"message","id":"83018367","parentId":"62149d31","timestamp":"2026-03-31T16:49:30.238Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I see - the config looks fine. The warning says \"global plugin will be overridden by global plugin\" which is confusing wording. Let me look at what the actual issue is.\n\nLooking at the error message:\n```\nplugins.entries.openclaw-weixin: plugin openclaw-weixin: duplicate plugin id detected; global plugin will be overridden by global plugin (/home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin/index.ts)\n```\n\nIt seems like the system is detecting two plugins with the same ID \"openclaw-weixin\":\n1. One from `plugins.entries.openclaw-weixin` in the config\n2. One from somewhere else (possibly auto-discovered)\n\nThe warning says \"global plugin will be overridden by global plugin\" which suggests there's some kind of double-loading happening.\n\nWait, looking more carefully at the earlier output from the install command, it said:\n```\nWARNING: Plugin \"openclaw-weixin\" contains dangerous code patterns...\nInstalling to /home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin…\nInstalling plugin dependencies…\n...\nplugins.allow is empty; discovered non-bundled plugins may auto-load: openclaw-weixin (/home/node/.openclaw/extensions/.openclaw-install-stage-pFltcW/index.ts), openclaw-weixin (/home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin/index.ts). Set plugins.allow to explicit trusted ids.\n```\n\nSo the issue is that there were TWO plugin directories:\n1. `/home/node/.openclaw/extensions/.openclaw-install-stage-pFltcW/` (temporary staging directory)\n2. `/home/node/.openclaw/extensions/openclaw-weixin/` (the actual plugin)\n\nI already deleted the temporary directory `.openclaw-install-stage-pFltcW`. But maybe the user is still seeing the warning because they haven't restarted the container yet, or there's something else going on.\n\nActually wait - the user sent the same warning message again. Maybe they haven't restarted the container yet after I deleted the temporary directory. \n\nThe staging directory was already removed, so the duplicate must be coming from somewhere else in the config or the system is still caching the old state. The user needs to restart the container for changes to take effect.","thinkingSignature":"30a018a4b1b880559ee299a3350def313330365f0e4872f2515dcddf0dd04351"},{"type":"text","text":"\n配置看起来正常。我之前已经删除了临时目录，但需要重启容器才能让改动生效。\n\n请在**宿主机**上执行：\n\n```bash\ndocker compose restart\n```\n\n重启后警告应该会消失。如果仍然出现，请把完整的警告信息发给我。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":52959,"output":499,"cacheRead":11957,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":65415,"cost":{"input":0.015887699999999998,"output":0.0005988,"cacheRead":0.00071742,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.017203919999999998}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774975758271,"responseId":"061b2e0efbc2696017623e8cc0ee48fd"}}
