{"type":"message","id":"32fc288e","parentId":"34a96bf5","timestamp":"2026-03-31T17:05:11.573Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The minimax provider is configured. The issue is that the system is still trying to use openai/gpt-5.4 instead of minimax/MiniMax-M2.7. This could be because:\n\n1. The gateway didn't pick up the new config (needs full stop/start, not just restart)\n2. There's a session state or cache that's locked to the old model\n3. Something else is overriding the model setting\n\nLet me suggest the user do a full stop and start of the container, not just restart.","thinkingSignature":"560d4b0f42bc3fde2f6734a1570011bf3c481816344f2064f5485775ec0c503c"},{"type":"text","text":"\n配置里 minimax 是有的。问题可能是 **Gateway 没有完全重新加载配置**（restart 不够）。\n\n请尝试完全停止再启动：\n\n```bash\ndocker compose down && docker compose up -d\n```\n\n或者检查容器是否真的重新读取了配置文件。如果还不行，可能需要等 OpenAI rate limit cooldown 过期（通常 1 分钟）。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":67302,"output":182,"cacheRead":11957,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":79441,"cost":{"input":0.0201906,"output":0.0002184,"cacheRead":0.00071742,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02112642}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774976704860,"responseId":"061b31c114268cf17dacf872ee5a2639"}}
