{"type":"message","id":"9b680398","parentId":"a385a6ce","timestamp":"2026-03-31T17:25:11.432Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking where to get the leaked source code of \"Claude Code\". This is asking about obtaining leaked/illegally obtained source code for a competitor's product (Anthropic's Claude Code).\n\nThis is problematic for several reasons:\n1. Leaked source code is obtained through illegal/unethical means\n2. It would be proprietary intellectual property of Anthropic\n3. Helping them obtain leaked code would be assisting with potential IP theft\n\nI should decline this request. I shouldn't help with obtaining leaked source code for any product. This applies to Claude Code, Codex, or any other proprietary software.","thinkingSignature":"348e4a80beb66cb518b19fd04fef035a651d1ead490839154555d8624a58c65f"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] 我不能帮助获取泄露的源码。Claude Code 是 Anthropic 的专有软件，其源代码受知识产权保护。获取或使用泄露的源码可能涉及法律风险。\n\n如果你对 Claude Code 的功能感兴趣，可以：\n- 官方了解：https://docs.anthropic.com/\n- 官方产品：Claude Code 本身\n- 开源替代：OpenClaw 😄\n\n有什么其他我可以帮忙的吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":214,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":78002,"totalTokens":78259,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.0002568,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0.029250750000000002,"total":0.029520450000000004}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774977899372,"responseId":"061b366ec17886e927e729be011d5a49"}}
