{"type":"message","id":"0f45cb7d","parentId":"f3bac77d","timestamp":"2026-03-31T17:36:50.075Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_qvolp4vfjda5_1","toolName":"read","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"version\": 1,\n  \"jobs\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"1c3a7bd5-d835-41d8-a14a-d2970f13d503\",\n      \"name\": \"daily-backup\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774507489594,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774915387884,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 0 * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"执行备份：cd ~/.openclaw && git add -A && git commit -m \\\"auto backup $(date +\\\\%Y-\\\\%m-\\\\%d)\\\" && git push && echo \\\"备份完成\\\"\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n        \"accountId\": \"lucus\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775001600000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774915200003,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"error\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 187881,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"unknown\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 2,\n        \"lastError\": \"Channel is required (no configured channels detected). Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"config-backup-8am\",\n      \"name\": \"config-backup-8am\",\n      \"enabled\": true,\n      \"createdAtMs\": 1774843680000,\n      \"updatedAtMs\": 1774944774164,\n      \"schedule\": {\n        \"kind\": \"cron\",\n        \"expr\": \"0 8 * * *\",\n        \"staggerMs\": 0\n      },\n      \"sessionTarget\": \"isolated\",\n      \"wakeMode\": \"now\",\n      \"payload\": {\n        \"kind\": \"agentTurn\",\n        \"message\": \"备份 openclaw.json：cp ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json.backup-$(date +%Y%m%d) && echo \\\"openclaw.json 备份完成 $(date)\\\"\"\n      },\n      \"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n        \"accountId\": \"lucus\"\n      },\n      \"state\": {\n        \"nextRunAtMs\": 1775030400000,\n        \"lastRunAtMs\": 1774944757062,\n        \"lastRunStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastStatus\": \"ok\",\n        \"lastDurationMs\": 17102,\n        \"lastDeliveryStatus\": \"delivered\",\n        \"consecutiveErrors\": 0,\n        \"lastDelivered\": true\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}"}],"isError":false,"timestamp":1774978610071}}
{"type":"message","id":"4ae66bde","parentId":"0f45cb7d","timestamp":"2026-03-31T17:37:03.228Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"I can see the issue now:1. **daily-backup** (daily at 0:00): error status, last error is \"Channel is required (no configured channels detected)\"\n2. **config-backup-8am** (daily at 8:00): ok status, delivered successfully\n\nThe daily-backup job is failing with the same error we saw before - it can't find the channel. This is the same issue as before, where the delivery channel configuration is not being properly detected in the isolated session.\n\nLet me check if the error is still the same as before or if it's changed. Looking at the state:\n- lastRunAtMs: 1774915200003 - this is about 18 hours ago\n- The error message is still \"Channel is required (no configured channels detected)\"\n\nThis is a persistent issue with the daily-backup job. The config-backup-8am works but daily-backup doesn't, even though they have similar configurations.\n\nLooking more closely:\n- config-backup-8am: lastDeliveryStatus: \"delivered\"\n- daily-backup: lastDeliveryStatus: \"unknown\"\n\nThe difference might be timing - the daily-backup runs at midnight when perhaps the system state is different, or there's some other issue.\n\nThe user previously said they tested it manually and it worked. But the scheduled runs are still failing. This could be because:\n1. The isolated session context is different from the main session\n2. There might be a timing issue\n3. The channel might not be properly initialized when the cron job runs\n\nI should report this to the user.","thinkingSignature":"70b9b1385148166e431c2aee1951a2a4013f22b3978183f2ae250985e93eea94"},{"type":"text","text":"## Cron 任务状态\n\n| 任务 | 调度 | 状态 | 最后运行 | 问题 |\n|-----|------|------|---------|------|\n| daily-backup | 每天 0:00 | ❌ error | 18小时前 | Channel 检测失败 |\n| config-backup-8am | 每天 8:00 | ✅ ok | 9小时前 | 正常 |\n\n**daily-backup 错误信息：**\n> Channel is required (no configured channels detected). Set delivery.channel explicitly or use a main session with a previous channel.\n\n**分析：**\n- `config-backup-8am` 正常工作并成功送达\n- `daily-backup` 却一直报 channel 检测失败\n- 两者配置几乎相同，但 `daily-backup` 在 isolated 模式下可能无法正确获取 channel 状态\n\n**建议：**\n1. 手动测试 `daily-backup` 仍然可以正常运行吗？\n2. 如果手动正常，可能是 midnight 时系统状态不同导致的偶发问题\n3. 也可以尝试把 `daily-backup` 的 delivery 改为 `inline` 模式（不依赖 channel 通知）\n\n要我帮你修改 `daily-backup` 的 delivery 模式吗？"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":67659,"output":578,"cacheRead":11957,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":80194,"cost":{"input":0.0202977,"output":0.0006935999999999999,"cacheRead":0.00071742,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.021708719999999997}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1774978610078,"responseId":"061b393273f0a0ef0e56dfe85dbde9b5"}}
