{"type":"message","id":"2bbf28fe","parentId":"eea53a3d","timestamp":"2026-03-31T17:38:44.679Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to fix the daily-backup cron job. The issue is that it's using \"isolated\" session target with \"announce\" delivery mode, which requires a channel. The error says \"Channel is required\".\n\nI should change the delivery mode to \"inline\" so it doesn't require a channel, or change the sessionTarget to something that works better.\n\nLet me modify the daily-backup job to use \"inline\" delivery mode instead of \"announce\".","thinkingSignature":"f51dbf5561722a8bad56e3e38812ae79798b6e35c0a6b0880276e050385d9ab5"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_sasiqm09ipb9_1","name":"edit","arguments":{"path":"/home/node/.openclaw/cron/jobs.json","old_string":"\"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"announce\",\n        \"channel\": \"feishu\",\n        \"to\": \"user:ou_cb5c7afa7e77cafdeaeae1620a2a383a\",\n        \"accountId\": \"lucus\"\n      }","new_string":"\"delivery\": {\n        \"mode\": \"inline\"\n      }"}}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":43,"output":224,"cacheRead":78221,"cacheWrite":1738,"totalTokens":80226,"cost":{"input":0.0000129,"output":0.0002688,"cacheRead":0.0046932599999999994,"cacheWrite":0.00065175,"total":0.00562671}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1774978716480,"responseId":"061b399d0b0d7860c5132a06f008db5c"}}
